#. module: l10n_se_account_banking_pain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_account_banking_pain/models/account_payment_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Account %(acc)s of %(partner)s has no known Swedish account type. Set "
"Bankgiro, Plusgiro, bank account or IBAN on the account."
msgstr ""
"Kontot %(acc)s för %(partner)s har ingen känd svensk kontotyp. Ange "
"bankgiro, plusgiro, bankkonto eller IBAN på kontot."

